    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42424</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>きみたち、ぼくがいない間、
大丈夫だった？　泣いてない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Were you okay while I was gone?
You didn't cry, or anything?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42524</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>泣いてないって。
オレらは赤ん坊じゃないんだぞ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nope, didn't shed a tear. Do
you think we're still babies?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42664</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだよ、ちょっと心細かったけど、
&lt;Rody&gt;さんや&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃんのおかげで平気だったよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. We were a little scared, but &lt;Rody&gt;
and &lt;Suzu&gt; were with us, so it was okay.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんのなんの。
&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんはちょっと涙目だったけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, think nothing of it. &lt;Mel&gt; did tear
up a little a couple times, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42876</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あれは眠くてアクビしたからですっ！
な、泣いてないもん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's 'cause I was yawning from lack
of sleep! I-I didn't cry! I didn't, okay!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……ぼくがいなかったせいで
夜も眠れない寂しい想いしたんだね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see... You were so lonely without
me that you couldn't even sleep...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43080</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ……そ、そうじゃなくて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... Th-That's not why...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43152</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_073_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>相変わらずの心配性</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She still worries
as much as ever.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>dunno how to make this sound okay

oh well</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
